# qprivately should absolutely become the running OS

This is the biggest opportunity in the repo.

Currently qprivately is partly:

> we did an action; let's produce a receipt afterward.

That is useful.

It is not enough.

The better architecture is:

```text
               QPRIVATELY KERNEL

         proposal
            ↓
        ActionSpec
            ↓
       deterministic gates
            ↓
     human authority if needed
            ↓
          GRANT
            ↓
       effect journal
            ↓
        EXECUTION
            ↓
     independent observation
            ↓
        verification
            ↓
   TransitionReceipt / settle
```

Influence becomes the userland around this kernel.

