# The correct approval chain

When the agent creates an Etsy listing revision:

```text
compile exact title
compile exact tags
compile exact description
select exact media
resolve exact price
resolve target listing
```

Freeze it.

Hash it.

Then display it.

Human approves that hash.

The grant contains that hash.

The executor checks:

```text
current payload hash == grant payload hash
```

before doing anything.

If a single character changes after approval:

> grant invalid.

Re-review required.

That is the whole value of qprivately authority.

