```

means:

> permission to attempt.

Not:

> action happened.

After approval:

```text
APPROVED
→ GRANTED
→ EXECUTING
→ VERIFYING
→ PROVEN_TRUE
```

or:

```text
UNKNOWN_RECONCILE
```

or:

```text
PROVEN_FALSE
```

Then and only then does the task close.

Humans should never need to click:

> ✓ done

for an API effect.

Proof should close it automatically.

